  installed .icy.  sprite-make --so is new: the plan runs to the shared
  object (MAKE_TARGET_OBJECT); it implies --cxx.  The Prelude compile builds
  the precompiled header member of the default flavor on the way.  The
  Python toolchain step (Json2Py) writes the bytecode cache (__pycache__,
  py_compile) right after it writes a .py file, with or without -B, and
